  _Name: The Healer
  Description: "Weak, yet helpful, The Healer works quietly to keep her team alive.
    When everything falls apart, she\u2019s the one who brings it back together.
    Before the Incident, she served as both a doctor and nurse at Apothem Labs, tasked
    with monitoring subjects and maintaining their condition during simulation tests.
    She\u2019s fragile, but fast and always knows what someone needs, even before
    they need it."
